    "content": "/* ==============================================================================\n * PROVENANCE METADATA (.lvm / .lane v1.0)\n * Architecture: LANE-VM Host Kernel x RFC 0103 Full-Duplex Engine\n * Rights Holder: Albert Dale Lane (EIN: 41-3119079) | Jurisdiction: Oregon, USA\n * License: Sovereign IP License v1.2 / Proprietary License Part A & B (All Rights Reserved)\n * Assertions: SEC Whistleblower #17684-273-411-436 | WashCo #50-267345\n * Authority: https://provenance.albertlane.net/.provenance.jsonld\n * Magic Header: 0x3F8F9A1B2C3D | Base Sequence Offset: 57000\n * ============================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --bg-color: #050505;\n    --text-main: #e0e0e0;\n    --accent: #00ff66;\n    --danger: #ff3333;\n    --font-stack: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: var(--bg-color);\n    color: var(--text-main);\n    font-family: var(--font-stack);\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\n.container {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 100vh;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1, h2 {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    font-weight: normal;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n    margin-bottom: 3rem;\n}\n\n.btn-forward {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: 2rem;\n    padding: 15px 30px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--accent);\n    color: var(--accent);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-forward:hover {\n    background-color: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg-color);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent);\n}\n\n#telemetry-console {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 20px;\n    left: 20px;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 20px;\n    z-index: 100;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n#data-readout {\n    color: #00ccff;\n}\n\n.scrollytelling-container {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 400vh;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n\n.simulation-header {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 20px;\n    right: 20px;\n    text-align: right;\n    z-index: 100;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n#collapse-meter {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.depth-node {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    opacity: 0.3;\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    letter-spacing: 5px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n",
